# Line endings: always LF in the repository and in WSL/Linux working trees, whatever tool commits (Windows editors,
# GitKraken, ...). CRLF breaks bash scripts ("bad interpreter: ^M") and shows up as spurious changes, which make
# release tags "-dirty". The executable bit can't be set here: commit it with `git add --chmod=+x <file>`.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

# Binary files: never touch them.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pfx   binary
*.p12   binary
